OL,3,GNEWSALeader rejects criticism of #215k
OL,4,ACEO recruitment
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Reform UK leader of a council said
OL,7,Fhe had "never been more pleased" with
OL,8,Fthe appointment of a chief executive
OL,9,Fwhose annual salary is #215,000.
OL,11,FNorfolk County Council selected Dennis
OL,12,FBacon, a Norwich hotel owner and the
OL,13,Fformer chairman of the Norfolk
OL,14,FIndependent Care Association, with 45
OL,15,Fcouncillors supporting the decision and
OL,16,F18 voting against the hire.
OL,18,FOpposition parties at the authority
OL,19,Fhave criticised the selection process,
OL,20,Fwhich involved one hour-long interview.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
