OL,3,GNEWSALeader rejects criticism of #215k
OL,4,ACEO recruitment
OL,5,
OL,6,FDavid Bick, the authority's leader,
OL,7,Fsaid candidates had been heavily vetted
OL,8,Fby council staff before the interview
OL,9,Fstage.
